{"path":"/documentation/_c","section":"documentation","title":"_c","description":"Documentation for the nnsight Python library","toc":[{"id":"nnsight._c","label":"_c","depth":2},{"id":"nnsight._c.__all__","label":"__all__\n\n\n  \n      module-attribute","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight._c.install_backtrace_guard","label":"install_backtrace_guard","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight._c.mount","label":"mount\n\n\n  \n      builtin","depth":3},{"id":"nnsight._c.unmount","label":"unmount\n\n\n  \n      builtin","depth":3},{"id":"submodules","label":"Submodules","depth":2}],"segments":[{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"nnsight._c\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-module\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-module-name\">_c</span>\n\n\n</h2>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Low-level, process-wide helpers nnsight installs at import.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>py_mount</code> — a small C extension that writes a method into <code>object</code>'s\n  type dict (bypassing its read-only <code>mappingproxy</code>), so it appears on <em>all</em>\n  objects. nnsight uses it to add <code>.save()</code> universally. Optional: if it didn't\n  build, <code>mount</code>/<code>unmount</code> are <code>None</code> and callers fall back to\n  <code>nnsight.save(value)</code>.</li>\n<li><a title=\"            backtrace\" href=\"/documentation/_c/backtrace#nnsight._c.backtrace\"><code>backtrace</code></a> — neutralizes glibc <code>backtrace()</code> so a torch C++ error\n  raised inside an interleaving greenlet surfaces as a normal Python exception\n  instead of segfaulting the process (see <a title=\"            install\" href=\"/documentation/_c/backtrace#nnsight._c.backtrace.install\"><code>backtrace.install</code></a>).</li>\n</ul>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight._c.__all__\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-attribute\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-attribute-name\">__all__</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-module-attribute\"><code>module-attribute</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"__all__ = ['mount', 'unmount', 'install_backtrace_guard']"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight._c.install_backtrace_guard\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">install_backtrace_guard</span>\n\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"install_backtrace_guard() -> bool"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Neutralize glibc <code>backtrace()</code> so a c10 error on a greenlet can't crash.</p>\n<p>Returns <code>True</code> if the guard is in place (including on a repeat call), and\n<code>False</code> if it was skipped -- unsupported platform, no glibc <code>backtrace</code>,\nor a page could not be made writable. Idempotent and never raises.</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight._c.mount\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">mount</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-builtin\"><code>builtin</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"mount()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Mount a function to all objects</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h3 id=\"nnsight._c.unmount\" class=\"doc-heading\">\n<code class=\"doc-symbol doc-symbol-heading doc-symbol-function\"></code>            <span class=\"doc-object-name doc-function-name\">unmount</span>\n\n\n  <span class=\"doc-labels\">\n      <small class=\"doc-label doc-label-builtin\"><code>builtin</code></small>\n  </span>\n\n</h3>"},{"type":"code","lang":"python","code":"unmount()"},{"type":"html","html":"<div class=\"doc-contents\">\n\n        <p>Unmount a function from all objects</p>\n\n\n    </div>"},{"type":"html","html":"<h2 id=\"submodules\">Submodules</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/documentation/_c/backtrace\">backtrace</a></li>\n</ul>"}]}